          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "这句话里的「不需要」我老是习惯用中文思维往 don't need to 上靠，但其实正确读法是 don't design around BearEcho's format",
          "start_time": 0.0,
          "end_time": 8.664,
          "language": "zh"
        },
        {
