          "end_time": 12.384,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "\n",
          "start_time": 37.992,
          "end_time": 37.992,
          "language": "en"
        },
        {
          "text": "这句话很精辟地描述了现在 AI agent 的现状",
